Dialogue: 6,0:00:02.54,0:00:04.50,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Putting that aside, Araragi-san.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:04.50,0:00:05.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 6,0:00:05.46,0:00:07.79,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:08.86,0:00:13.26,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Then let's go eat somewhere once Senjougahara comes back.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:13.26,0:00:16.00,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Do you have anything you like to eat?
Dialogue: 6,0:00:17.06,0:00:19.55,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I like any kind of food.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:20.35,0:00:23.19,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Your hands were also rather tasty. {rinTLC: orig: "Your hands are also delicious." TASTY is a win word, though.}
Dialogue: 6,0:00:23.19,0:00:25.02,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,My hands are not food.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:25.02,0:00:28.44,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,You're just being humble. They really were tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:33.36,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Speaking of which, you probably really did swallow some of my flesh and blood,{\i0}
Dialogue: 6,0:00:33.66,0:00:36.65,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I can't exactly take your words lightly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 6,0:02:22.03,0:02:27.12,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hachikuji, I don't quite understand why, but you want to see your mother, correct?
Dialogue: 6,0:02:27.37,0:02:32.95,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I was under the belief that it's rather normal for children to want to see their mother. Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 6,0:02:32.95,0:02:34.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Well, of course not, but...
Dialogue: 6,0:02:34.46,0:02:40.13,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,You live with your parents, right? That's why you don't understand.
Dialogue: 6,0:02:40.13,0:02:44.17,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,If you lived by yourself, I think you would want to see them, too.
Dialogue: 6,0:02:44.17,0:02:45.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Is that how it is? {rinTLC: or "I wonder..." or "Is that how it is?" or "You could be right...", uncertainly and questioning. :x}
Dialogue: 6,0:02:47.05,0:02:54.23,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,From the way you've been speaking, I get the feeling that you don't really like your parents.
Dialogue: 6,0:02:54.23,0:02:56.56,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's not like that. I just...
Dialogue: 6,0:02:58.73,0:03:02.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Up until middle school, I was a really good kid.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:02.61,0:03:05.82,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I didn't disobey my parents for any reason.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:05.82,0:03:08.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I was really grateful to them for raising me.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:09.49,0:03:10.70,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,How nice.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:10.70,0:03:14.04,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But when I got to high school, I fell behind in my studies.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:15.41,0:03:19.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Then the good-kid image that I had maintained took a complete turn.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:19.46,0:03:22.55,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I had this unspeakable, unpleasant kind of feeling.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:24.71,0:03:27.51,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,Brother, you're always like that!
Dialogue: 6,0:03:27.51,0:03:32.72,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Because of that, they said that's why no matter how much time passes, I'll never grow up.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:32.72,0:03:36.73,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Never growing up. Always just a child. Apparently.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:37.94,0:03:41.31,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,A child? Then you're just like me.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:41.31,0:03:44.28,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I think it's a bit different than you, honestly.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:44.28,0:03:46.02,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,They probably mean something along the line of,
Dialogue: 6,0:03:46.02,0:03:48.36,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,"He's grown up on the outside, but inside he hasn't changed at all." {rinTLC: literally, "gotten big on the outside, but the inside isn't keeping up"}
Dialogue: 6,0:03:49.32,0:03:53.87,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,But you know, Araragi-san, I'm considered quite mature amongst my classmates.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:53.87,0:03:56.66,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's true. Your chest {\i1}is{\i0} pretty developed.
Dialogue: 6,0:03:57.50,0:04:00.08,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,You touched it?! When did you touch it?!
Dialogue: 6,0:04:00.08,0:04:02.25,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,When we were fighting. {rinTLC: or "grappling" or just "fighting" or whatever the hell you think best describes what they were doing.}
Dialogue: 6,0:04:03.84,0:04:06.46,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,My first touch has been taken!
Dialogue: 6,0:04:06.46,0:04:07.76,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,First touch?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:08.84,0:04:12.26,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,To actually have a first touch before a first kiss!
Dialogue: 6,0:04:12.26,0:04:15.97,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Hachikuji Mayoi has turned into a pervert! {rinTLC: or "dirty" or "lewd" or "indecent" ... you get the point.}
Dialogue: 6,0:04:15.97,0:04:20.40,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right, Hachikuji-chan. I completely forgot.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:20.40,0:04:22.48,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I promised you that I'd give you some allowance, didn't I?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:22.48,0:04:24.77,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Please don't say that with such horrible timing!
Dialogue: 6,0:04:28.61,0:04:31.03,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,There, there, there. {rinTLC: like a "calm down" sort of expression}
Dialogue: 6,0:04:31.03,0:04:33.91,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Araragi-san, you don't look even the least bit apologetic.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:33.91,0:04:37.70,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,You should at least say something after touching a girl's delicate chest!
Dialogue: 6,0:04:39.87,0:04:40.92,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Thanks?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:41.67,0:04:44.21,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,No, I'm asking you to apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:47.38,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, it doesn't really matter, does it? It's not that big a deal. {rinTLC: Second part is literally "it's not something that decreases"... you know, you don't have a limited number of chest touches before they're all gone, basically. If you want to put something like that, and can make it sound good, feel free I guess.}
Dialogue: 6,0:04:47.38,0:04:49.17,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,They say that they'll get bigger if you rub them. {rinTLC: HE'S TALKING ABOUT HER BOOBIES.}
Dialogue: 6,0:04:49.17,0:04:52.47,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,What?! You've been using that superstition as a shield
Dialogue: 6,0:04:52.47,0:04:55.01,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,to constantly touch girls' breasts, haven't you?!
Dialogue: 6,0:04:55.01,0:04:56.26,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,You're the worst. {rinTLC: this is a common (literal) translation. I personally like "You're horrible" or something along those lines better, but I will defer judgement. :p}
Dialogue: 6,0:04:56.26,0:04:59.52,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I've never had such an opportunity.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:59.52,0:05:01.10,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I see you're just a stupid virgin, aren't you?{?}
Dialogue: 6,0:05:04.81,0:05:07.57,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's dangerous! Seriously, it's dangerous! {rinTLC: i hate japanese}
Dialogue: 6,0:05:07.57,0:05:10.45,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I've been touched by a virgin! I've been contaminated!
Dialogue: 6,0:05:10.45,0:05:13.16,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's the same no matter who touches you!
Dialogue: 6,0:05:13.16,0:05:15.78,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to lose my slight feeling of guilt! {rinTLC: I feel like the ! makes it almost sound like he's regretting it; he is not. fix this, unless i'm crazy.}{changed from "gradually budding" to "slight."}
Dialogue: 6,0:05:18.70,0:05:20.96,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore! What are you, a rabid dog?! {rinTLC: he doesn't technically say "dog", but i think it sounds better in english.}
Dialogue: 6,0:05:20.96,0:05:24.50,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Since it's like this, who cares about the first?! Who cares about a kiss?!
Dialogue: 6,0:05:24.50,0:05:28.00,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'll rub your chest until you don't care about that anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.34,0:05:43.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,There was a high school boy who was going to forcibly sexually harass an elementary school girl.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:43.73,0:05:47.69,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But... just this once, I don't want to believe that's me.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:50.07,0:05:52.28,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 6,0:05:53.74,0:05:54.82,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 6,0:05:56.03,0:05:58.37,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I should be the one apologizing.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:58.37,0:06:02.21,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But Hachikuji, you sure know how to put up a fight.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:02.21,0:06:05.83,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,It happens a lot in school. You put up a good fight, too.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:05.83,0:06:09.42,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I used to always fight like that with my sister. {rinTLC: rephrase?}
Dialogue: 6,0:06:09.42,0:06:14.01,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I suppose this sort of fight is over if one side apologizes...
Dialogue: 6,0:06:16.43,0:06:19.81,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ararararagi-san?
Dialogue: 6,0:06:19.81,0:06:21.89,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,This time there are two extra "ra"s.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:21.89,0:06:23.60,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Pardon me. I stuttered.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:24.85,0:06:26.48,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, that was on purpose.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:26.48,0:06:27.56,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I st-stuttered.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:27.56,0:06:28.90,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It wasn't on purpose!?
Dialogue: 6,0:06:28.90,0:06:33.19,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I can't help it. Everyone misspeaks at some point.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:33.19,0:06:37.87,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Or are you saying that you haven't stuttered once since you were born?
Dialogue: 6,0:06:37.87,0:06:42.58,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Not exactly, but at least I don't stutter when saying someone else's name.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:42.58,0:06:46.71,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Then, please say "nanamumi nanamome namamamamo" three times.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:46.92,0:06:48.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} didn't even say it right.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:48.54,0:06:51.05,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Namamome is so obscene!
Dialogue: 6,0:06:51.05,0:06:52.76,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You said it, not me.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:52.76,0:06:55.17,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Namamamamo is obscene, too!
Dialogue: 6,0:06:55.17,0:06:58.22,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,How is that obscene? I don't really get it...
Dialogue: 6,0:06:58.22,0:07:03.31,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, won't saying it intentionally be more difficult?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:03.31,0:07:04.73,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Namamamamo.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:04.73,0:07:06.60,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Namamamamo!
Dialogue: 6,0:07:08.35,0:07:11.48,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Then may I know what happened, Araragi-san?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:11.48,0:07:13.03,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Nothing much.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:13.03,0:07:18.53,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I just thought of how I should apologize to my sister, and I got a bit depressed.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:18.53,0:07:20.07,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Having to apologize...
Dialogue: 6,0:07:20.07,0:07:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you touched her breasts?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:21.49,0:07:23.95,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Who would touch their own sister's breasts?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:23.95,0:07:28.42,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,When I left the house today, I sort of had a quarrel with my sister.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:28.42,0:07:32.59,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I used to fight constantly with my mother and father, too.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:32.59,0:07:34.30,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Not physically, though.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:34.30,0:07:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only verbally.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:37.76,0:07:40.60,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,As an only daughter, it's not really my place to say this, but...
Dialogue: 6,0:07:40.60,0:07:43.56,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,They looked like a happy couple on the surface.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:43.56,0:07:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've never seen them get along...
Dialogue: 6,0:07:48.52,0:07:51.69,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,They were constantly fighting.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:54.86,0:07:58.45,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You love your mother, don't you?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:58.45,0:08:00.20,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Yes, I love her.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:00.20,0:08:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I love my father as well.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:03.87,0:08:13.75,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Even though my father and mother fought constantly and eventually split up, I still love them both.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:13.75,0:08:15.21,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:15.21,0:08:17.92,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,That's why, because of that, I'm feeling uneasy.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:17.92,0:08:22.18,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,My father seems to hate my mother a lot.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:22.18,0:08:25.22,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Because of that, he doesn't let me see her.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:26.43,0:08:30.73,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I wonder, if this continues, will I forget my mother someday?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:30.73,0:08:35.65,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,If I can never see her again, will I stop loving her someday?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:35.65,0:08:37.36,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I'm so uneasy... {rinTLC: in a "worried", "anxious" sense}
Dialogue: 6,0:08:41.32,0:08:43.32,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I smell another woman.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:46.87,0:08:49.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,O-Oh, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:49.46,0:08:51.21,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,This scent of shampoo...
Dialogue: 6,0:08:51.92,0:08:53.83,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It belongs to Hanekawa-san, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:54.59,0:08:55.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.38,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,To a certain extent.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:57.38,0:09:03.09,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You can also think of it as using the shape of the waist to differentiate women.
Dialogue: 6,0:09:03.09,0:09:06.14,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I don't remember displaying such special abilities.{?}
Dialogue: 6,0:09:07.43,0:09:08.60,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You can't do it?
Dialogue: 6,0:09:08.60,0:09:11.06,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Don't react like it's not ordinary!
Dialogue: 6,0:09:11.06,0:09:15.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You have an outstanding pelvic stance. It looks rather suitable for childbirth,
Dialogue: 6,0:09:15.08,0:09:19.15,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,so I think you'll be able to give birth to a healthy baby.
Dialogue: 6,0:09:20.61,0:09:23.74,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Didn't you say that to me recently?
Dialogue: 6,0:09:24.91,0:09:26.87,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Those were the words of some other pervert out there!
Dialogue: 6,0:09:26.87,0:09:29.58,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then, Hanekawa-san came, didn't she?
Dialogue: 6,0:09:29.58,0:09:31.08,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, she came.
Dialogue: 6,0:09:31.08,0:09:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She already went home, though.
Dialogue: 6,0:09:32.29,0:09:34.33,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She merely passed by.
Dialogue: 6,0:09:36.42,0:09:40.42,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You must have heard the details from Oshino-san, right, Senjougahara?
Dialogue: 6,0:09:43.18,0:09:48.01,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, it seems that I have to apologize to you.
Dialogue: 6,0:09:48.01,0:09:50.98,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Oshino-san told me I should.
Dialogue: 6,0:09:50.98,0:09:54.85,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What could you possibly need to apologize for?
Dialogue: 6,0:09:54.85,0:10:02.07,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Even if there's only one actual truth, you can have two truths from two different perspectives.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:02.07,0:10:07.32,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,A method to determine which truth is true doesn't actually exist.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:07.32,0:10:11.79,Default,Hitag,0,0,0,,There's no real method of proving your truth in this world.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:13.12,0:10:18.84,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But believing that you're wrong for that reason is also wrong.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:20.09,0:10:24.97,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,He talks as if he can see right through you.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:24.97,0:10:26.34,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I hate that.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:26.76,0:10:28.51,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What the hell are you saying?
Dialogue: 6,0:10:28.51,0:10:31.31,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, not you, but rather Oshino.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:31.31,0:10:35.64,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What you said doesn't seem to have any connection with the current situation.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:35.64,0:10:43.69,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,The way to get released from the snail, the lost cow, is apparently rather simple.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:43.69,0:10:49.83,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You get lost because you follow the snail, so if you go away from it, you won't be lost.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:49.83,0:10:52.12,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You get lost because you follow it?
Dialogue: 6,0:10:52.12,0:10:58.33,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,In the case of the snail, it seems that the human that becomes its target is led astray. {rinTLC: <&Kaf|ZzZ> or, rather - "invites strangeness" <&Kaf|ZzZ> good chance he's saying that if you're the target of a lost snail <&Kaf|ZzZ> you're apt to exhibit strange behavior <&Kaf|ZzZ> ie. <&Kaf|ZzZ> Koyomi fighting little lolis that aren't there [13:09] <&Kaf|ZzZ> so "led in the direction of the strangeness - ie. snail/abnormality}
Dialogue: 6,0:10:58.33,0:11:02.84,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's why you only need to get away from the snail.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:02.84,0:11:05.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, not me, right? Hachikuji does.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:08.64,0:11:11.60,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But if it's like that, don't you find it weird?
Dialogue: 6,0:11:11.60,0:11:15.06,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She didn't follow the snail on her own.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:15.06,0:11:17.98,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,There's no way she'd want that.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:17.98,0:11:23.61,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's why I need to apologize to you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:25.07,0:11:28.24,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But, even so, I hope you'll let me explain.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:28.24,0:11:30.70,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I didn't have any bad intentions.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:30.70,0:11:33.33,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Besides, it wasn't on purpose.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:33.33,0:11:37.33,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I thought for certain that I had made a mistake.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:37.33,0:11:39.17,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 6,0:11:39.17,0:11:40.63,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well, think about it.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:40.63,0:11:45.05,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,For over two years, I have not been normal.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:45.05,0:11:49.01,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If something happened, I would think that it was my fault.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:49.01,0:11:50.55,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:50.55,0:11:52.97,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 6,0:11:52.97,0:11:54.72,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Hachikuji-chan, is it?
Dialogue: 6,0:11:56.64,0:11:58.44,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Basically, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 6,0:11:58.44,0:12:03.61,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You felt bad on Mother's Day, fought with your sister, didn't want to go back home...
Dialogue: 6,0:12:04.78,0:12:05.82,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 6,0:12:09.99,0:12:11.87,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I can't see her.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:17.45,0:12:20.17,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,It was just about 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:20.17,0:12:25.38,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,At a certain place, a husband and wife walked toward the end of marriage.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:25.38,0:12:29.76,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,It was decided that their only daughter would go with the father.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:30.30,0:12:33.30,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,No matter what one's memories are, they get worn down.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:33.30,0:12:35.97,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,No matter what one's memories are, they deteriorate.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:35.97,0:12:39.52,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,With the flow of time, the only daughter was shocked.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:39.52,0:12:43.77,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,She no longer remembered her mother's face.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:43.77,0:12:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she looked at her mother's photos,
Dialogue: 6,0:12:45.48,0:12:49.53,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,she couldn't tell if that was really her own mother anymore.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:50.61,0:12:57.29,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,That's why the only daughter decided to go see her mother on the Mother's Day of that year.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:57.29,0:13:04.29,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,But she did not reach her mother's home.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:04.29,0:13:07.92,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I wonder why. Why?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:08.59,0:13:11.30,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Really, why was that?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:11.30,0:13:15.18,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,The traffic light was clearly green.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:16.01,0:13:19.22,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,That only daughter is me.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:21.56,0:13:25.36,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,From then on, were you always lost?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:25.36,0:13:30.36,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,A person who cannot reach her destination will hinder another person's way home.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:30.36,0:13:32.40,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Going around in circles.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:32.40,0:13:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, Hachikuji.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:36.28,0:13:41.96,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But are you sure you can't see Hachikuji?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:41.96,0:13:44.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,No, I can't even hear her voice.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:44.46,0:13:46.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But you were acting so naturally...
Dialogue: 6,0:13:46.54,0:13:48.30,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I can't see that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:51.26,0:13:54.76,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,The only thing I see is a person talking to himself.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:54.76,0:13:57.72,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,The last thing I saw was Araragi-kun going crazy.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:57.72,0:14:00.60,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I totally didn't understand what you were doing.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:03.81,0:14:06.06,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,If it's like that, you only need to tell me...
Dialogue: 6,0:14:06.06,0:14:08.90,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,811)}Like I said, there's no way I could just say it.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:08.90,0:14:10.61,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's impossible for me to just say it.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:10.61,0:14:15.28,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If such a thing happened... If the thing that you could see, I couldn't...
Dialogue: 6,0:14:15.28,0:14:19.54,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then I would normally think that it's me that has a problem.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:20.54,0:14:21.95,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:21.95,0:14:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara doesn't want to feel that something is wrong with her again.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:26.04,0:14:29.25,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She doesn't want to feel that she became abnormal once again...
Dialogue: 6,0:14:29.25,0:14:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't want me to feel that way either...
Dialogue: 6,0:14:31.84,0:14:34.97,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's why she pretended to be able to see Hachikuji.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:36.59,0:14:37.76,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:39.64,0:14:43.10,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,The one who ran into the snail... was me?
Dialogue: 6,0:14:43.10,0:14:52.36,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, Oshino-san said that the criteria for meeting the lost cow is the desire not to return home.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:53.19,0:14:56.53,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But everyone thinks that sometimes.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:56.53,0:14:59.28,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Every family has their problems, no matter who they are.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.50,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She's the same.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:03.50,0:15:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Friction and strain in her family...
Dialogue: 6,0:15:06.42,0:15:11.96,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But because of that, Araragi-kun, dealing with the lost cow is very simple.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:11.96,0:15:15.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I said from the start that as long as you stop following it and distance yourself, it'll be okay.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:15.67,0:15:17.22,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's all you need to do...
Dialogue: 6,0:15:19.22,0:15:24.06,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,"It's a strange thing that isn't very evil or strong."
Dialogue: 6,0:15:24.06,0:15:27.10,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,"It isn't really a dangerous threat in the first place." That's what he said.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:27.10,0:15:28.15,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 6,0:15:28.15,0:15:29.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's why...?
Dialogue: 6,0:15:29.19,0:15:31.44,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Then what, Senjougahara?
Dialogue: 6,0:15:34.90,0:15:37.20,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What I mean is how to get this girl-
Dialogue: 6,0:15:37.82,0:15:42.62,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,How to get Hachikuji to her mother's place.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:45.08,0:15:47.41,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 6,0:15:47.41,0:15:50.33,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,This child does not exist there.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:50.33,0:15:53.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,She does not exist there, nor does she exist anywhere.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:53.67,0:15:58.43,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Hachikuji. The child called Hachikuji Mayoi-chan...
Dialogue: 6,0:16:00.64,0:16:02.22,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,is already dead.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:02.22,0:16:07.02,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's why this child is not being possessed by something, but is that something itself.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:07.85,0:16:09.23,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 6,0:16:09.23,0:16:11.65,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,A-Araragi-san, it hurts.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:12.86,0:16:18.45,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Araragi-san, everything is exactly as Senjougahara-san said.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:18.45,0:16:21.03,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I... I'm...
Dialogue: 6,0:16:21.03,0:16:22.41,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 6,0:16:23.41,0:16:26.41,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You may not have heard it, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:26.41,0:16:33.75,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,This girl said some really outrageous things to me and Hanekawa from the start.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:33.75,0:16:37.49,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please don't speak to me. I hate you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 6,0:16:40.59,0:16:42.39,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Senjougahara?
Dialogue: 6,0:16:42.39,0:16:48.06,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Because she doesn't want anyone to follow her, that's why she says such things to everyone she meets.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:48.06,0:16:49.73,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Can you understand that?!
Dialogue: 6,0:16:50.19,0:16:56.02,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I totally don't understand, but even so, when I was missing and when I was all alone,
Dialogue: 6,0:16:56.02,0:17:00.74,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,the feeling of having the need to say such things...
Dialogue: 6,0:17:00.74,0:17:04.53,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You and I... haven't we experienced the same thing, just in a different way?!
Dialogue: 6,0:17:06.24,0:17:10.91,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Even though you can't see her, hear her voice, or even smell her...
Dialogue: 6,0:17:10.91,0:17:13.42,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Even so... That's why...
Dialogue: 6,0:17:13.42,0:17:18.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's my duty to bring her safely to her mother's side.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:22.80,0:17:24.51,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I knew you would say that.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:26.14,0:17:29.39,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I finally understand you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:30.85,0:17:36.82,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,When you found out about my problem,
Dialogue: 6,0:17:36.82,0:17:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you took the initiative to speak to me on that day.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:42.91,0:17:44.03,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Why is that so?
Dialogue: 6,0:17:45.45,0:17:49.20,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Did you perhaps offer help solely because it was me?
Dialogue: 6,0:17:50.62,0:17:52.62,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But that wasn't the case.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:53.00,0:17:54.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That wasn't the case.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:54.83,0:17:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It was purely...
Dialogue: 6,0:17:56.59,0:17:59.92,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,because you'll save anyone, right?
Dialogue: 6,0:17:59.92,0:18:04.55,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Save them... it's nothing that amazing. You're exaggerating.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:04.55,0:18:12.48,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But two years after encountering that strange thing, even though many people realized my problem... {rinTLC: fix "strange thing" please :)}
Dialogue: 6,0:18:12.48,0:18:16.56,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,the only person like you was you.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:16.56,0:18:19.82,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Well, sure. I'm just me.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:19.82,0:18:22.11,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's right. Of course.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:27.03,0:18:29.74,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,This is the last message Oshino-san left, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:30.95,0:18:35.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,"Just this once, I'll teach you a trick that can be of use."
Dialogue: 6,0:18:35.08,0:18:36.21,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Trick?
Dialogue: 6,0:18:36.21,0:18:37.63,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:37.63,0:18:38.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Go? Where to?
Dialogue: 6,0:18:40.42,0:18:43.38,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,To Tsunade-san's house, of course.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:43.38,0:18:45.84,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,And, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 6,0:18:45.84,0:18:46.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 6,0:18:57.56,0:18:59.69,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:05.82,0:19:09.70,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,The lost cow, as an anomaly, is a ghost-type.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:09.70,0:19:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to this, it can't store new\Ninformation-oriented memories.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.96,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Information-oriented memories are, basically, knowledge.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:18.33,0:19:19.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:20.88,0:19:25.13,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's understandable for a person like me who has no geographic knowledge at all.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:25.13,0:19:28.26,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But for Senjougahara, who can't even see the snail, to be lost...
Dialogue: 6,0:19:28.26,0:19:30.97,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Still, something you don't know will still be unknown.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:30.97,0:19:33.89,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No. Even if you know, you will be unable to react.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:34.77,0:19:37.06,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But this is...
Dialogue: 6,0:19:37.06,0:19:39.48,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,For instance, take the district map.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:39.48,0:19:44.48,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,If you only choose the newly-built routes, the lost cow will be unable to react.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:45.28,0:19:48.74,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,After an hour going somewhere that shouldn't even take ten minutes,
Dialogue: 6,0:19:49.28,0:19:52.37,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,we finally reached the destination.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:52.37,0:19:53.08,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 6,0:20:02.46,0:20:05.67,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara, are you sure this is the place?
Dialogue: 6,0:20:05.67,0:20:07.84,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 6,0:20:08.93,0:20:11.26,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I don't believe it... {rinTLC: literally, "Something like this actually exists?" in a disbelieving manner.}
Dialogue: 6,0:20:37.20,0:20:39.41,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 6,0:20:56.35,0:20:58.93,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You've done well, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 6,0:20:58.93,0:21:01.10,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You were perhaps a tiny bit cool.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:01.10,0:21:04.11,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,This time it's all thanks to you, though.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:04.11,0:21:09.49,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Even so, that's not what I mean, you know.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:09.49,0:21:10.78,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:11.74,0:21:14.45,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You have not given me an answer yet.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:15.91,0:21:17.37,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 6,0:21:17.37,0:21:21.00,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, I think you might have misunderstood something.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:21.00,0:21:24.21,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Look, didn't you mention something about repaying me?
Dialogue: 6,0:21:24.21,0:21:25.88,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That was only an excuse.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:25.88,0:21:29.05,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I merely wanted you to confess on your own. {rinTLC: in the sense of "confess your love" / "ask me out"}
Dialogue: 6,0:21:31.72,0:21:33.14,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:33.14,0:21:38.31,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't really feel that I owe you something big.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:39.06,0:21:42.44,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Because you love to help others.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:44.02,0:21:47.44,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But even if the person that was being helped was not me...
Dialogue: 6,0:21:47.44,0:21:52.49,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Even if, from the side, I watched you help Hanekawa-san or the others...
Dialogue: 6,0:21:52.49,0:21:57.28,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I would still have developed special feelings for you.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:57.99,0:22:01.83,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well, though I seem to have said this before...
Dialogue: 6,0:22:03.29,0:22:09.59,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If you insist, I find talking to you to be fun. That's all.
Dialogue: 6,0:22:09.92,0:22:12.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But we haven't really talked that much, have we?
Dialogue: 6,0:22:13.09,0:22:14.18,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 6,0:22:15.55,0:22:17.93,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's why I hope to speak more with you.
Dialogue: 6,0:22:19.14,0:22:20.81,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,How do I put it...?
Dialogue: 6,0:22:21.81,0:22:26.86,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because I've taken a liking to you. That's why I want to try hard, or something like that anyway.
Dialogue: 6,0:22:26.86,0:22:28.02,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 6,0:22:28.02,0:22:31.86,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,All right, well how about you think of it like this?
Dialogue: 6,0:22:31.86,0:22:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, a psychotic virgin,
Dialogue: 6,0:22:34.70,0:22:40.04,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,starved for love and likely to fall for anyone who would be a little nice to her, has set her eyes on you.
Dialogue: 6,0:22:40.04,0:22:41.50,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 6,0:22:41.50,0:22:43.00,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You are really unlucky.
Dialogue: 6,0:22:43.00,0:22:44.92,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Blame it on your habitual actions.
Dialogue: 6,0:22:49.09,0:22:53.80,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If you are to say something stupid like, "Give me a bit of time to consider,"
Dialogue: 6,0:22:53.80,0:22:55.76,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I will despise you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 6,0:22:55.76,0:22:59.01,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Don't let a girl feel shameful.
Dialogue: 6,0:22:59.01,0:23:00.26,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 6,0:23:00.26,0:23:03.56,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,At this point in time, I feel that I'm really horrible.
Dialogue: 6,0:23:03.56,0:23:08.52,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But is it all right if I offer one condition?
Dialogue: 6,0:23:10.23,0:23:14.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Not really a condition... It's more like a promise.
Dialogue: 6,0:23:14.61,0:23:17.36,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,A promise? What is it?
Dialogue: 6,0:23:17.36,0:23:21.45,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara, pretending to see things that you actually can't...
Dialogue: 6,0:23:21.45,0:23:24.20,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Or pretending not to be able to see something you really can...
Dialogue: 6,0:23:24.20,0:23:27.08,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No more of that, from now on.
Dialogue: 6,0:23:27.08,0:23:31.63,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,If our views clash, then let us properly talk about it.
Dialogue: 6,0:23:31.63,0:23:32.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Promise me.
Dialogue: 6,0:23:32.80,0:23:34.51,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,A simple request.
Dialogue: 6,0:23:37.68,0:23:40.93,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Then let's get going. It's already getting dark.
Dialogue: 6,0:23:43.47,0:23:47.44,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, could you clearly say it for me?
Dialogue: 6,0:23:47.44,0:23:48.65,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Say it?
Dialogue: 6,0:23:48.65,0:23:50.98,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Because I hate unclear relationships.
Dialogue: 6,0:23:50.98,0:23:53.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You mean that?
Dialogue: 6,0:23:56.82,0:23:58.20,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I hope this will be popular.
Dialogue: 6,0:23:58.20,0:23:59.41,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 6,0:23:59.41,0:24:01.87,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,"Senjougahara fascination."
Dialogue: 6,0:24:08.33,0:24:09.96,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,Koyomi, it's morning!
Dialogue: 6,0:24:09.96,0:24:13.59,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,You have to wake up!
Dialogue: 6,0:24:13.59,0:24:18.68,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I promised that on Mother's Day next year, I will definitely not take a single step from home.
Dialogue: 6,0:24:18.68,0:24:20.14,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It may be a good thing.
Dialogue: 6,0:24:20.14,0:24:22.93,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,Mom said we'll be washing the bedsheets today!
Dialogue: 6,0:24:22.93,0:24:27.02,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,She said that she can only start washing when you wake up!
Dialogue: 6,0:24:27.02,0:24:30.69,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,When morning came, my sisters seemed to have calmed down.
Dialogue: 6,0:24:51.04,0:24:52.83,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Aren't you...?
Dialogue: 6,0:24:52.83,0:24:54.04,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Aragi-san.
Dialogue: 6,0:24:54.04,0:24:56.38,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You left out a "ra" this time.
Dialogue: 6,0:24:56.38,0:24:58.84,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I stuttered.
Dialogue: 6,0:24:59.09,0:25:00.30,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 6,0:25:01.09,0:25:03.55,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Well, how do I put it...?
Dialogue: 6,0:25:03.55,0:25:09.93,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Um... I have been promoted from an earthbound spirit into a wandering spirit.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:09.93,0:25:12.27,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Which means I was promoted two ranks.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:13.81,0:25:15.36,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Umm, Araragi-san...
Dialogue: 6,0:25:15.36,0:25:19.65,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I will probably be around here for the time being.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:21.28,0:25:24.24,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,If you see me, please talk to me.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:26.24,0:25:26.87,Default,PV,0,0,0,,I'm Karen.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:26.87,0:25:27.49,Default,PV,0,0,0,,I'm Tsukihi.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:27.49,0:25:28.70,Default,PV,0,0,0,,An octopus spits ink.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:28.70,0:25:29.04,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Spits, huh?
Dialogue: 6,0:25:29.04,0:25:30.25,Default,PV,0,0,0,,There's also a fish that spits ink.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:30.25,0:25:30.62,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Spit-Spit!
Dialogue: 6,0:25:30.62,0:25:31.62,Default,PV,0,0,0,,You might think that's all.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:31.62,0:25:33.00,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Eh? Don't tell me they inhale ink!
Dialogue: 6,0:25:33.00,0:25:34.25,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Ehh.. it's not like that.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:34.25,0:25:34.75,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Well, which is it?
Dialogue: 6,0:25:34.75,0:25:37.25,Default,PV,0,0,0,,You know... there is a fish which spits ink!
Dialogue: 6,0:25:37.25,0:25:38.30,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Akanagana, right?
Dialogue: 6,0:25:38.30,0:25:39.13,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{WHAT YOU SAY?!} How do you know that?!
Dialogue: 6,0:25:39.13,0:25:40.84,Default,PV,0,0,0,,I know of most black things!
Dialogue: 6,0:25:40.84,0:25:42.05,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Time for today's baseball quiz!
Dialogue: 6,0:25:42.05,0:25:42.72,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Quiz!
Dialogue: 6,0:25:42.72,0:25:44.09,Default,PV,0,0,0,,You are a baseball pitcher.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:44.09,0:25:45.55,Default,PV,0,0,0,,The pitcher raises his hands above his head and pitches.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:45.55,0:25:50.18,Default,PV,0,0,0,,But the first, second, and even the third and fourth pitch are all fouled off straight pitches!
Dialogue: 6,0:25:50.18,0:25:51.10,Default,PV,0,0,0,,No control!
Dialogue: 6,0:25:51.10,0:25:52.10,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Now for the question!
Dialogue: 6,0:25:52.10,0:25:53.73,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Your fourth pitch was...
Dialogue: 6,0:25:53.73,0:25:55.65,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Who would know that?
Dialogue: 6,0:25:55.65,0:25:57.77,Default,PV,0,0,0,,It couldn't be a straight...
Dialogue: 6,0:25:57.77,0:25:59.61,Default,PV,0,0,0,,Next time, Suruga Monkey Part 1.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:59.61,0:26:01.15,Default,PV,0,0,0,,It was a question of straight pitch victory or defeat!
Dialogue: 6,0:26:01.15,0:26:01.90,Default,PV,0,0,0,,It wasn't clever.
